hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"28025","Narrated Abu Bakr Al-Hanafi, he said: narrated Usamah ibn Zayd, from Amr ibn Shuayb, from Umm Kurz Al-Khuzaiyyah, she said: The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) was brought a boy, so he urinated on him, so he ordered for it and it was sprinkled, and a girl was brought, so she urinated on him, so he ordered for it and it was washed."
